title: "supabaseInit (stem-bot-v2: src/utils/supabase.ts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_read_env: supabaseUrl = SUPABASE_URL or NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL
    q_read_env --> q_read_key: supabaseKey = SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY or NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY
    q_read_key --> q_check: validate url and key exist
    q_check --> q_error: !supabaseUrl or !supabaseKey
    q_check --> q_create: both exist
    q_error --> [*]: throw Error
    q_create --> [*]: createClient(url, key, schema member)

    note right of q_read_key
        INV-001: Falls back from SERVICE_ROLE_KEY to ANON_KEY without distinction
        INV-002: SERVICE_ROLE_KEY bypasses RLS - if used, all DB queries run with full privileges
        INV-003: Schema hardcoded to "member"
    end note
